  "body": "## Change and scope\n\nAt base `0b1cccf86e2f5132ed286a26ef0a681a495740ea`, the historical positive-side audit spends substantial time in `scripts/audit_joint_frames.py:product`, which multiplies rational matrices entrywise with many intermediate `Fraction`s.\n\nThis PR clears denominators once per factor, multiplies with Python integers, and rebuilds canonical `Fraction`s. The product is entrywise equivalent. Only the source pin for `audit_joint_frames.py` changes inside `certificates/rank-product-core.json`.\n\n**Tooling improvement; no new kappa.** Selected frontier untouched.\n\n## Result\n\nOn Linux / CPython 3.12, five alternating fresh-process pairs of the positive-side stream gave median **26.143 \u2192 7.302 s (3.58\u00d7)**. Timing is host-descriptive and is not a correctness gate. Positive-side experiment receipts stay fieldwise identical.\n\nPackage: `research/joint-frames-cleared-product/`.\n\n## Validation\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -I -B research/joint-frames-cleared-product/verify.py\npython3.12 -I -O -B research/joint-frames-cleared-product/verify.py\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/joint-frames-cleared-product\npython3.12 -I -B research/joint-frames-cleared-product/benchmark.py --rounds 5\n```\n\nExpected:\n\n```text\nPASS_JOINT_FRAMES_CLEARED_PRODUCT positive_side_cases=12 random_cases=2500 certs=1 no_new_kappa\nPASS_REGISTERED_RESEARCH_PACKAGE research/joint-frames-cleared-product outcome=completed\nPASS_IDENTICAL_POSITIVE_SIDE_RECEIPTS\n```\n\nDefault verify is read-only. Full `make verify`, selected cold replay, Lean, and multiplication-theorem obligations were not rerun for this isolated historical-checker change.\n\n## Overlap and credit\n\nClosest priors (different objects): [CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds#756](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/756), [CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds#1793](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1793), [CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds#1861](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1861), [CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds#1217](https://github.com/CrocSwap/integer-mult-bounds/pull/1217). No competing open PR on cleared-denominator `product` at refresh.\n\nPredecessor joint-frame / positive-side checker authors retain credit. Prepared by Wentao Li ([VictorLiwentao](https://github.com/VictorLiwentao), [@Is__Victor](https://x.com/Is__Victor)) with substantial AI assistance, under Apache-2.0.",
